      "problem": "The linear form $f(x)$ is defined as $f(x)=ax,$ where $a=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 & 4\\end{aligned}].$  Evaluate the function when $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$",
